post.description:
The token replaces the one the user had for the same server, if any;
their tokens for other servers are kept. Agents that use the server are
compiled and run with it.

tools.description:
Every tool the agent can call, first-seen order, with its kind and its
bundle — the MCP server or workspace it comes from. For listing;
[`AgentFeatures::tool_kinds`] is the summary.
